  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Philippus de Piccolominibus et Thomas de Tolomeis constituimus inter nos societatem mercatorum ad exercendum negotium lanae et pannorum in civitate Senarum et extra, pro tempore quinque annorum continuorum, ponentes in commune Philippus centum quinquaginta florenos auri et Thomas centum florenos auri, et lucrum et damnum dividantur per aequas partes inter nos ...</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si vero altera pars contra hanc societatem venire praesumpserit vel rationes reddere recusaverit, poenam quinquaginta florenorum auri solvere teneatur, et societas nihilominus firma permaneat usque ad finem termini constituti ...</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Iacobus de Salimbenis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Angelus de Bichis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Guido de Saracinis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
